  "body": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span><ruby>샬<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby><ruby>샬<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby> 교’됴릐</span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/o1e83c87hKI?version=3&amp;rel=1&amp;showsearch=0&amp;showinfo=1&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;fs=1&amp;hl=en&amp;autohide=2&amp;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一聲<rt>짇샬ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一聲<rt>짇샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>叫<rt>교</rt></ruby>’됴릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-siā̰-jit-siâ̰ lêh-kio’tio-li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn1\" id=\"_ftnref1\"><strong>¹</strong></a> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>滴<rt>딯</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bak-sài chīn-chiṵ̄, hor-jùi tih\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>自從<rt>주졍ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>離開<rt>리퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>’꽈, <ruby>暗暝<rt>암ˋ미ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>變成<rt>볜ˋ솅-</rt></ruby><ruby>日<rt>띧ˆ</rt></ruby>’시\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ju-jióng lì li-khûi’goa, àm-mí pièn-sieng-rît’si\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>暝<rt>미ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>日<rt>띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>思念<rt>수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-mí bo-rît lai-sū-liām’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想起<rt>슐키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>過去<rt>궤ˋ킈</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>誓言<rt>세ˋ꼔ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-khî-kuè-khi’e sè-gién\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>如今<rt>뚜김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>變<rt>볜ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>緣<rt>옌ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ru-kîm î-kiēng-pièn-bo-yén\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>過站<rt>궤ˋ잠ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>火車<rt>훼ˆ챠ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>斷線<rt>등솰</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>風吹<rt>헝ˉ췌ˆ</rt></ruby><a href=\"#_ftn2\" id=\"_ftnref2\"><strong>²</strong></a> \n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kuè-jām’e huê-chiâ, tng-soa̰’e hōng-chuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>愛情<rt>애ˋ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chīn-chiṵ-lî-goà’e ài-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>心愛<rt>심ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā~ sīm-ai’e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為啥物<rt>위샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>絕情<rt>좓졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-siâ̰-mîh lì nà jiâh-joat-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>一聲<rt>짇샬ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>一聲<rt>짇샬ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>咧<rt>렣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>叫<rt>교</rt></ruby>’됴릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    jit-siā̰-jit-siâ̰ lêh-kio’tio-li\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>目滓<rt>빡새ˋ</rt></ruby> <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌ˉ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>雨水<rt>허쥐ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby>滴<rt>딯</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bak-sài chīn-chiṵ̄, hor-jùi tih\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>自從<rt>주졍ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>離開<rt>리퀴ˆ</rt></ruby>’꽈, <ruby>暗暝<rt>암ˋ미ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>變成<rt>볜ˋ솅-</rt></ruby><ruby>日<rt>띧ˆ</rt></ruby>’시\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ju-jióng lì li-khûi’goa, àm-mí pièn-sieng-rît’si\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>暝<rt>미ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>日<rt>띧ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>來<rt>래-</rt></ruby><ruby>思念<rt>수ˉ럄ˉ</rt></ruby>’릐\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    bo-mí bo-rît lai-sū-liām’li\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想起<rt>슐키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>過去<rt>궤ˋ킈</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>誓言<rt>세ˋ꼔ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-khî-kuè-khi’e sè-gién\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>如今<rt>뚜김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>變<rt>볜ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>緣<rt>옌ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ru-kîm î-kiēng-pièn-bo-yén\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>過站<rt>궤ˋ잠ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>火車<rt>훼ˆ챠ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>斷線<rt>등솰</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>風吹<rt>헝ˉ췌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kuè-jām’e huê-chiâ, tng-soa̰’e hōng-chuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>愛情<rt>애ˋ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chīn-chiṵ-lî-goà’e ài-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>心愛<rt>심ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā~ sīm-ai’e láng\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>為啥物<rt>위샬ˆ밓ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>릐<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby>哪<rt>나ˋ</rt></ruby> <ruby title=\"jiâh\">遮<rt>쟣ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>絕情<rt>좓졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    wi-siâ̰-mîh lì nà jiâh-joat-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>想起<rt>슐키ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby>過去<rt>궤ˋ킈</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>誓言<rt>세ˋ꼔ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    siṵ-khî-kuè-khi’e sè-gién\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>如今<rt>뚜김ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby>已經<rt>이ˆ곙ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby>變<rt>볜ˋ-</rt></ruby><ruby>無<rt>뽀-</rt></ruby><ruby>緣<rt>옌ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ru-kîm î-kiēng-pièn-bo-yén\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>過站<rt>궤ˋ잠ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <span style=\"text-indent:0;display:inline-block\"><ruby>火車<rt>훼ˆ챠ˆ</rt></ruby>,</span> <ruby>斷線<rt>등솰</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>風吹<rt>헝ˉ췌ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    kuè-jām’e huê-chiâ, tng-soa̰’e hōng-chuê\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>親像<rt>친ˉ츌-</rt></ruby><ruby>릐<rt>ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby>꽈<rt>ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>愛情<rt>애ˋ졩ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    chīn-chiṵ-lî-goà’e ài-jiéng\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<p>\n  <span class=\"lyric-line\">\n    <ruby>아<rt>ˍ</rt></ruby>~ <ruby>心愛<rt>심ˉ애</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby>人<rt>랑ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span class=\"lyric-lomari\">\n    ā~ sīm-ai’e 